<title>USA: TABLE - UST Inc Q2 shr rise slightly.</title>
<headline>TABLE - UST Inc Q2 shr rise slightly.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						Second Quarter</p>
<p>					 1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net sales			$365,107     $350,542</p>
<p>Costs and expenses</p>
<p>  Cost of products sold	 71,358	 67,048</p>
<p>Selling, advertising and</p>
<p>  administrative(A)	    103,858	 88,229</p>
<p> Interest, net		     2,582	  1,749</p>
<p>  Total costs and expenses   177,798	157,026</p>
