<p>three-month period, 1996</p>
<p>includes common stock</p>
<p>  equivalents		    183,620	192,803</p>
<p>					  Six Months ended June 30,</p>
<p>					  1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net sales			$705,646     $678,333</p>
