<p>outstanding during the</p>
<p>six-month period, 1996</p>
<p>includes common stock</p>
<p>  equivalents		    183,614	193,721</p>
<p>NOTE - (A) Both periods of 1997 include income from the prepayment of royalties received in connection with a previous divestiture of $25.7 million, offset by a write-down of production costs for the entertainment subsidiary of $24.1 million.  Also included in the six month period of 1997 is a one-time charge of $6.6 million resulting from recording the present value of future obligations arising under employment contracts for two former executive officers.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
